  m_text: This is a strategic puzzle game where you don't direct the performance,
    but organize the show behind the scenes. The player forms a team of artists,
    each with their own skills, tags ("stylish", "charismatic", etc.) and quirks
    (for example, "conflicts with magicians"). Your task is to choose the perfect
    lineup, avoiding conflicts and adhering to the level requirements to get the
    highest rating and profit. The performance itself is only simulated, the result
    depends on the balance of skills, synergy and solving internal "problems" in
    the team.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e6708824976cd1541a54fe1d02336992, type: 2}
